  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">我的整合包專用字型</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/nekoropolia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nekoro Pokemon</a></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">。<br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">搭配使用 </span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/nekoro-dm-pu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nekoro Dark Mode</a>&nbsp;</span>與 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/nekoro-eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nekoro Enchanted Books</a></span>。</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">由於我對英文與波蘭文以外的字母較不熟悉，部分字元可能顯示不正確；若您發現任何問題，歡迎在留言區告知。<br><br></span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fnekoropolia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975384/description_8a33147a-1e7a-41f5-8660-d16dbf7857fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></a><br></span></p>",
